<title>FINLAND: Rauma sells subsidiary to Swedish firm.</title>
<headline>Rauma sells subsidiary to Swedish firm.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy said in a statement on Thursday it had sold its Rauma Ecoplanning Oy subsidiary to Swedish chemical engineering group Chematur Engineering AB.</p>
<p>The parties had agreed to not disclose the price of the deal, Rauma said, adding annual net sales of Rauma Ecoplanning, which specialises in environmental technology, were about 110 million markka.</p>
</text>
